      "en": "“Therefore behold, I will allure her, and bring her into the wilderness, and speak tenderly to her.",
      "ko": "그러므로 내가 저를 개유하여 거친 들로 데리고 가서 말로 위로하고",
      "source_text_hash": "e20b76deada36c48a28863db4a117b7fa5f7ca84fd5a19944bc9b2865795377a",
      "translation_text_hash": "a39211f5cbf6c69b2e0f343d63fd0154846f528189776499f6003c6ec784bf27",
